Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#141414\">We will return with various content improvements, so please stay tuned.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#141414\">Thank you.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1734686780237\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/c36ea544bfcc4db8adc893d757cc907d_1734686780237_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n"
